\title "Reverse roll"
\subtitle "Bluegrass three-finger picking, open G, 1-bar loop"
\copyright "Pattern under MIT or Apache-2.0."
\tempo 80
\tuning D4 B3 G3 D3 G4
.
// The natural pair to the forward roll: same three-string cycle
// (1 → 3 → 5) but starting on the high D4 string instead of the
// drone. Pattern is M-I-T-M-I-T-M-I, mirror of forward's
// T-I-M-T-I-M-T-M. Practice them back-to-back to feel how each
// reshapes the melodic emphasis.
//
//   col 0  string 1 (D4, middle)
//   col 1  string 3 (G3, index)
//   col 2  string 5 (G4 drone, thumb)
//   col 3  string 1
//   col 4  string 3
//   col 5  string 5
//   col 6  string 1
//   col 7  string 3
:8 0.1 0.3 0.5 0.1 0.3 0.5 0.1 0.3 |
:8 0.1 0.3 0.5 0.1 0.3 0.5 0.1 0.3 |
